# Coleção REST Client (VS Code). Preencha os endpoints conforme as issues forem concluídas.
@as = https://localhost:9443
@app = https://localhost:8443

### Descoberta
GET {{as}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### JWKS
GET {{as}}/jwks.json

### /userinfo sem token -> 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{as}}/userinfo
